        "1 session of the 2 allowed; stop reason: delivered; both ledgers intact"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "What was simulated, what was not run",
      "items": [
        "Simulated: only the codex binary, a stand-in called with the real codex recipe of config/harnesses.toml",
        "The stand-in loads .codex/config.toml, AGENTS.md, the skill and the sub-agents, starts the MCP server, makes one model call through the gateway, calls budget_status, spawn_agent and deliver",
        "Real: the launcher, the MCP server, the OpenAI API, the Scaleway and Runpod offer APIs",
        "Not run: race_vm.py, the dashboard, reap and the jury"
      ]
    },
